    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "\"the one that lets you finally rest\" ... that sounds almost peaceful. like everything just stops. it's like you're saying it's okay to just stop existing if the person who was supposed to live is already gone. that's what you mean, right? that there's no reason to fight to stay in a world where i'm already a ghost?",
